                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Harbour Hall is ten minutes on foot from the central station. Every stage is step-free; there is a quiet room, a parents’ room and gender-neutral bathrooms on every floor."
