              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Live captions on the main stage and in every recording. Sign-language interpretation on request — tell us two weeks ahead and we will arrange it."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tab",
              "attrs": {
                "title": "Code of conduct"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Expohall is for everyone. Harassment of any kind is not tolerated. Find a volunteer in a yellow lanyard, or message the safety line printed on your badge."
